              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Linda"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this drink as written and it did not taste like a Long Island Iced Tea. Made two important changes and it did. It needed 2 ounces of sour mix to give it that lemoney tang and I only used enough cola to change the color to that of ice tea. I mixed all ingredients with the exception of the cola in a shaker filled with ice, shook, then poured that into a glass and then topped with the cola. With changes 5 stars.",
            "datePublished": "2011-10-09T14:22:35.230Z"
          },
          {
